---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy - Fable">
  <div style="margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
    <h1>Privacy Principles</h1>
    <p class="lead">Your workspace stays on your device. Fable does not use cloud proxies to process your core data.</p>
    
    <div class="card">
      <p>Fable is designed from the ground up to respect your digital autonomy:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>No Fable Account required</strong>: Use all core features locally.</li>
        <li><strong>Encrypted SQLite Vault</strong>: Your settings, schedules, and local index data are encrypted on disk.</li>
        <li><strong>Local Credentials Store</strong>: API keys remain inside your operating system's native keychain.</li>
        <li><strong>Zero Remote Analytics</strong>: No trackers, telemetry, or cookies are loaded without your active consent.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <p>For more details, see our <a href="/privacy-policy">Full Draft Privacy Policy</a> (DRAFT — Legal Review Required).</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
